{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13427","headline":"和考功员外杪秋忆终南旧宅之作 · 常衮","name":"和考功员外杪秋忆终南旧宅之作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"静忆溪边宅，知君许谢公。\n晓霜凝耒耜，初日照梧桐。\n涧鼠喧藤蔓，山禽窜石丛。\n白云当岭雨，黄叶绕阶风。\n野菓垂桥上，高泉落水中。\n欢荣来自间，羸贱赏曾通。\n月满珠藏海，天晴鹤在笼。\n余阴如可寄，愿得隐墙东。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"常衮","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13427.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13427","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}